---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Institutional Partners | KIPROD"
  description="Institutions that have partnered with KIPROD in strengthening credit risk capability, governance, and institutional performance."
  activePath="/partners"
>

<section class="about">

<div class="section-inner">

<div class="section-tag">
Institutional Partnerships
</div>

<h1 class="section-heading">
Working Together to
<em>Strengthen Institutions</em>
</h1>

<p class="section-sub">
KIPROD partners with financial institutions, regulators, government agencies,
professional bodies, and learning organisations to strengthen governance,
institutional capability, operational performance, and sustainable growth.
</p>

</div>

</section>

<section class="about">

<div class="section-inner">

<div class="section-tag reveal">
Featured Institutions
</div>

<h2 class="section-heading reveal">

Institutional Sectors
<em>We Support</em>

</h2>

<p class="section-sub reveal">

A growing portfolio of institutions across Kenya's financial sector and
beyond.

</p>

<div class="about-grid" style="margin-top:50px">

  <!-- Commercial Banking -->
  <div class="mini-panel reveal">
    <div class="mini-title">Commercial Banking</div>

    <p class="mini-note">
      Supporting commercial banks through governance reviews,
      executive capability development, portfolio management,
      credit risk strengthening, and operational improvement.
    </p>

    <ul class="bullets">
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Family Bank</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Commercial Banking Institutions</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Executive Credit Teams</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Risk Management Departments</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- SACCO Sector -->
  <div class="mini-panel reveal">
    <div class="mini-title">SACCO Movement</div>

    <p class="mini-note">
      Strengthening governance, credit administration,
      collections, recovery, and institutional capability
      across the SACCO sector.
    </p>

    <ul class="bullets">
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Stima SACCO</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Deposit-Taking SACCOs</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Non-Deposit SACCOs</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Executive Leadership Teams</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Government -->
  <div class="mini-panel reveal">
    <div class="mini-title">Government Institutions</div>

    <p class="mini-note">
      Capability development, governance programmes,
      institutional strengthening, and leadership support
      within the public sector.
    </p>

    <ul class="bullets">
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Kenya Revenue Authority (KRA)</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Government Agencies</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Public Sector Institutions</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>State Corporations</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Learning & Professional Development -->
  <div class="mini-panel reveal">
    <div class="mini-title">Learning & Professional Development</div>

    <p class="mini-note">
      Developing professional capability through executive
      education, faculty engagement, and accredited learning
      programmes.
    </p>

    <ul class="bullets">
      <li><span class="dot"></span>NITA</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Universities</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Corporate Academies</li>
      <li><span class="dot"></span>Professional Associations</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="trust-quote reveal" style="margin-top:60px">

<p>

"Our institutional partnerships are built on a shared commitment to
strengthening governance, enhancing capability, improving operational
performance, and delivering sustainable credit risk excellence across
the financial sector."

</p>

<footer>

KIPROD Institutional Engagement Framework

</footer>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section
  class="about"
  style="
    background: var(--cream);
    padding-top: 70px;
    padding-bottom: 70px;
  "
>

  <div class="section-inner">

    <div class="section-tag">
      The KIPROD Journey
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-heading">
      Every Partnership Follows a
      <em>Structured Methodology</em>
    </h2>

    <p class="section-sub">
      Institutional partnerships are delivered through the KIPROD
      Institutional Engagement Methodology, ensuring every engagement
      progresses from discovery to continuous performance improvement.
    </p>

    <div class="implementation-grid">

      <div class="implementation-card">
        <div class="implementation-number">01</div>
        <h3>Discover</h3>
        <p>Institutional conversations and engagement scoping.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="implementation-card">
        <div class="implementation-number">02</div>
        <h3>Assess</h3>
        <p>ILCA, ICDF and ICAR institutional capability assessments.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="implementation-card">
        <div class="implementation-number">03</div>
        <h3>Learn</h3>
        <p>Capability development through the KIPROD Academy.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="implementation-card">
        <div class="implementation-number">04</div>
        <h3>Implement</h3>
        <p>RMS implementation and operational strengthening.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="implementation-card">
        <div class="implementation-number">05</div>
        <h3>Monitor</h3>
        <p>Continuous improvement through the Command Centre.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>

